ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLi Hua, a vendor in the village, often sells fruit in the market. One day, he finds that a box of his apples disappears. On the same day, Zhang Wei, a customer who often visits Li Hua's stall, accidentally finds this box of apples behind the market. He thinks someone abandons these apples, so he takes them home. On the other hand, Wang Li, Zhang Wei's neighbor, knows these apples belong to Li Hua, but because she does not get along with Zhang Wei, she deliberately does not tell him the truth. A few days later, Li Hua learns about the whereabouts of the apples while chatting with friends.\n\n[Question]\nWang Li knows these apples belong to Li Hua but does not tell Zhang Wei, what kind of emotion does she feel?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Wang Li possibly feels indifferent because she thinks it is none of her business.\nB. Wang Li possibly feels guilty because she knows she does something wrong.\nC. Wang Li possibly feels satisfied because she uses this opportunity to deal with her disliked neighbor.\nD. Wang Li possibly feels worried, afraid that the truth comes out.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0021826172463897424,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0e0d6006945d27fd7a8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367712911,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:32","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"733f18a7cd814515bed19a85d34b4301"}